DESCRIPTION:The BreatheFL 5K Turkey Trot is a family run or walk at Ferry 
 Park in Fort Walton Beach on Saturday\, November 14 at 9 AM. It benefits 
 BreatheFL Inc.\, a nonprofit supporting families of children with chronic
  respiratory illness. Two water and aid stations are on the course\, and 
 the post-race party has music\, food\, vendors and a kids zone. Entry is 
 $35 for the run or the walk.\nPrice: from $35\nArea: Destin & Fort Walton
